@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Inoltro di una Richiesta con Bilanciamento del Carico
autonumber

actor "Client / Browser" as Browser
participant "Client\n(thread)" as ClientThread
participant "ConfigurationManager" as CM
participant "LoadBalancingStrategy" as Strategy
participant "Servizio Backend" as Backend

Browser -> ClientThread : apre connessione TCP\ne invia richiesta HTTP
activate ClientThread

ClientThread -> ClientThread : parseRequest() -> HttpRequest

ClientThread -> CM : getRoutes()
activate CM
CM --> ClientThread : List<Route>
deactivate CM

ClientThread -> ClientThread : cerca la Route\ncorrispondente al path

alt Route trovata
  ClientThread -> CM : getLoadBalancingStrategy()
  activate CM
  CM --> ClientThread : strategy
  deactivate CM

  ClientThread -> Strategy : selectService(services)
  activate Strategy
  Strategy --> ClientThread : Service (host, port)
  deactivate Strategy

  ClientThread -> Backend : apre socket e inoltra\nla richiesta HTTP
  activate Backend
  Backend --> ClientThread : risposta HTTP (stream)
  deactivate Backend

  ClientThread --> Browser : inoltra la risposta (copyData)
else Nessuna Route trovata
  ClientThread --> Browser : chiude la connessione
end

deactivate ClientThread

@enduml
